    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "body": "Better Card is implemented as a default-off Tweak. It uses FF8's native Card predicate, removes only enemies whose common and rare Card results are both FF from the Card target mask, and disables the command when no valid target remains. It shares one dispatcher with Draw Once so the two Tweaks do not overwrite each other. Executable, composition, and mutation checks pass. Please test a mixed enemy group and a group with no cardable enemies in battle.",
